      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIDNIGHT THUNDER (6) box seated before sticking on well to finish 2.25 lengths away in second (25.62) at this track in a Grade 5 over 450m. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Key chance in this line up. WANGARATTA GIRL (1) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (26.59) last time in a Grade 4/5 at Warragul. Solid winning record at this trip. Was a winner at her only start from this draw. Has ability and can atone. IVORY INZAI (3) jumped from an outside draw and finished in the frame when a 3 length third (28.50) at Bendigo in Grade 5. Failed to fire only run here. Will give a great sight again. KRAKEN MAIN (2) can sneak into the finish.",
